In Raising Raichu, Raichu was used to battle the Masked Man. Later, when Surge encountered the Red Gyarados at the Lake of Rage, he used Raichu to power up his submarine's underwater laser. However, as the thawed wasn't willing to fight him, but instead trying to break another block of ice at the bottom of the lake, Surge ended up using the laser on the ice block, which turned out to contain some of the gears of and , who had previously fought the Masked Man at the lake.

Raichu was also briefly seen in Hello, Lickitung, where Surge used his sharp tail as a warning for Morty to not to struggle against him, as well as in Yikes, It's Yanma!, where he was seen standing alongside Surge during the introduction of the Kanto and Johto Gym Leaders.


